WEBVTT

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.820
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:00.790
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:03.290
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:07.800
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:13.600
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:17.540
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:25.650
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:32.950
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:38.490
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:45.630
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:51.110
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:53.540
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:01:53.540 --> 00:02:00.480
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.750
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.820
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:09.320
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:13.860
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:19.670
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:22.570
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:56.590
<i>♪ First strike... If born a man, you should</i> <i>know how to make a woman happy... ♪</i>

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:11.850
I'd like my sword repaired.

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:16.750
I'd like... my sword repaired.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.960
I refuse.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:22.960
Why?

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:27.630
Shall I enhance your limited brain power?

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:34.610
I said I refuse, sonny.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:38.380
So... why?

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:42.320
You should know the answer.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:45.750
It's because I pity the sword that you'll use.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:53.090
Is it finished?

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:56.100
Oh, it's you? It's complete.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:04:02.160
But I had a little difficulty with it.
I'd never seen a sword like it before.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.740
Here, oop...

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.110
Thanks.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:10.100
Heavy...

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:15.080
You?!

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:20.620
Draw your sword, and you're dead.

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:42.180
Why did you let me live?!

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:46.510
You're deep in despair right now.

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.010
You're not even worth killing.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.330
Why?

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:08.670
Why did you refuse my sword and repair his?

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:12.510
He brought chaos to the town of Morok!

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:15.480
So why did you repair his sword?!

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:18.970
Because there's no right or wrong in swordsmanship.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:26.620
I daresay the evil lies in not understanding the essence of the sword.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:30.930
I want... I want to grow strong...

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.930
To protect Yuufa.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.370
That's... all I want...

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:42.100
Hand it over.

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:44.910
Hand over the sword, I said.

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:47.310
Huh? But...

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:50.950
It's because your eyes are glowing now.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:57.150
After you saw that person, you became a completely different man.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:02.460
Only! Never forget this...

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:07.830
I'll get you if you should ever make your sword cry again.

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:51.270
It's finished.

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:55.200
Thank you.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:13.590
You can make a woman cry, but never make your sword cry.

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:15.560
<i>♪ Second strike... ♪</i>

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:20.900
<i>♪ Born a man you must know</i> <i>how to forge a sword... ♪</i>

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:36.520
<i>You could fight, because of</i> <i>your sword's strength, not your own.</i>

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:44.890
<i>You have no strength. Not to</i> <i>protect Yuufa or even your own self.</i>

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:49.000
You're not even worth killing.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:53.260
Oh? You're...

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.860
You three...

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:06.010
Oh, my. What happened to that Acolyte that was with you?

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:09.650
Could it be that she dumped you?

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:12.990
Whoa. Don't look so angry.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:15.420
It's a joke. A joke.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:20.430
Could it be that you're alone now?

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:23.300
If you are, why not join our band?

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:24.970
B-Boss Lady...

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:26.370
That ain't...

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:33.640
Oh, why not? I've gotten tired of looking at your faces all the time.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:40.150
We're gonna go to Izlude to celebrate his becoming a Rogue.

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:42.720
How about coming with us?

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:47.360
You shouldn't do that, Boss, teasing sonny boy.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.960
He'd never come with us.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:55.000
Right, right. Besides, he's too weak to do anything.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:58.030
Sure. I'll join your band.

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:01.570
See? He says he'll join us...

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.070
--Huh?!
--Huh?!

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:05.240
Are you sure about this? Hey.

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:09.940
Yeah. I'll do anything to get stronger.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.410
You...

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:16.720
Those bloodshot eyes...
They really turn me on.

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.590
Boss!

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:22.260
We're supposed to be the leading men this time.

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:26.830
Will you quit your whining?
C'mon, let's go!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.350
--Right!
--Right!

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:37.040
Milk at low prices. Milk!

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:40.780
We'll be your purchasing agent!

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:44.280
Too expensive. Make it cheaper!

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:48.440
Complain, and we'll wreck your cart!

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:55.960
Okay! I'm gonna be a Swordsman!

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:58.020
I'm going to be an Acolyte!

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:02.800
When you're a Swordsman, protect me, okay?

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:04.560
Sure, of course!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.640
I'm disappointed in you!

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:15.810
I was wrong to place my dear sister in your care, Roan!

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:19.080
No! I did my very best!

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:24.590
You did your best?
But all you do is hang around Yuufa.

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:26.650
How foolish.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:31.190
Effort and ability are not the same.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:32.390
But!

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:36.860
More than that, Roan, you're not useful at all.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:41.470
I can't do anything by myself?
No, you're the one.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.310
What a pitiful man...

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:45.470
Shut up!!

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:49.180
Is yowling the only adult thing you can do? Sonny...

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:55.150
Shut up! Shut up!! Don't call me sonny!!

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:57.890
Sonny... Sonny...

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:00.520
Hey! Sonny!

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:04.660
What're you doing?
We'll leave you behind.

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:11.470
Sonny, we won't stop you if you want to die by yourself, but this is our band.

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.730
Forget about the past.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:21.680
That's how we live. We can't change what's already happened.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:29.820
But you see, nobody can move forward if they regret and worry about it.

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:34.590
We're all comrades with scarred souls.

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:38.060
Scarred souls?

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:45.870
This girl reported an attempted extortion. Who did it?!

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.460
They're the ones!

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:53.300
Just run, will ya?!

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:00.720
My boat!

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.550
--So long!
--So long!
--So long!

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:05.050
Drat!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.660
Send out an all-points bulletin!

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:12.960
For a band of two Rogues, one Blacksmith, and one Swordsman!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:19.160
Now you're really one of us.

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:25.970
Byalan Island...

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:30.670
The underwater cave there will be the main event.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:39.780
Let's go!

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:49.260
<i>♪ Wait for us, wait for us, little treasure ♪</i>

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:52.320
<i>♪ Come out, come out, Monsters ♪</i>

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.590
--Gangster...

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:25.970
--...Paradise!

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:28.600
What's yer problem?!

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:31.040
Got a beef?!

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:35.380
Adrenalin Rush!

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:40.170
Snatcher!

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.210
Whaddya think?

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.610
Graffiti!

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:56.560
--We're the best!
--We're the best!
--We're the best!

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:03.400
Obonnu!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:06.610
That's crazy!

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:08.580
Stop!

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:22.490
We managed to defeat her.

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:24.920
Barely, just barely.

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:34.000
Sonny, ask us before you go attacking any Monsters, will y...

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:39.870
Mals!

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:42.440
You fool!!

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:45.950
Listen to us!!

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:48.610
Stop!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:59.790
Boss Lady, say something to him...

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:02.830
We can't take this much longer...

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:10.200
Little Boy, choose foes that you can defeat.
You'll be destroyed if you keep this up.

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:11.600
I just...

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:16.310
I want to grow strong!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.610
Come off it!

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:24.110
You can be strong or weak if you want, but don't get us mixed up in it!

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.270
Crap!

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:43.300
Sonny, your weapon is a Fire Sword, right?

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:46.610
You can't use any heat-related weapon here.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:50.240
This is... This is fine.

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:58.720
H-Hey!

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:01.450
There're too many of them!

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:26.110
H-Hey, you'd better cool it, already...

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.950
Not by a long shot.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:40.260
I'm gonna be stronger. For that...

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:43.100
I don't care if I die!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.570
D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:56.230
Half Fishman?!

00:16:57.240 --> 00:17:03.020
We are gonna die. For sure.
Without fail. We are so-o dead!

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.920
You fool!!

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:37.250
B-Boss Lady, what'll we do?

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:40.820
F-Fool! What <i>can</i> we do?!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:27.970
Am I hopeless, after all?

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:33.770
If I can't grow strong, then I'm done.

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:39.010
Sorry. I guess I wasn't a good owner.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:43.140
I hope somebody good finds you next time.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.620
Yuu... fa...

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.140
Reflect!

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:19.180
Shield!

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:25.260
Amazing!

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:32.890
Holy Cross!

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:42.680
Are you all right?

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:50.250
Thank you, ma'am.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:53.220
You must not throw your life away.

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:57.420
It is not courage to face a foe you cannot defeat.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:59.790
It is folly.

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:01.420
Who are you?

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:08.340
I am a Crusader. One who fights holy wars.

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:12.610
And I am one who protects others.

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:14.230
One who protects...

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:18.810
That technique was...

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:39.490
Maaya-<i>chan</i>!

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:54.910
Are you all right, Maaya-<i>chan</i>?

00:20:57.750 --> 00:21:00.620
That's Al de Baran?

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.970
Roan...

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:22.780
Please!

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:25.470
Please take me with you!

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:37.410
If someone makes a request, we must oblige.

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:40.720
That is the duty of the Crusader.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:46.060
Yes, ma'am! I'll be counting on your help!

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:06.550
Agh. They got us, didn't they?

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:09.490
Too many Obonnu.

00:22:09.490 --> 00:22:14.360
And Sonny Boy just split.

00:22:14.360 --> 00:22:19.200
Is this the end of our appearances?

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:21.260
Just shut the hell up!

00:22:27.910 --> 00:22:30.170
My butt's freezing.

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round</i> <i>that will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:38.350
<i>This is Defaulte. Next is...</i>
<i>Oh, our time is already up.</i>

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:42.080
<i>Next time,</i> "Why Won't You Answer?"

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:45.310
<i>We look forward to your next visit.</i>
